726
01:09:43,937 --> 01:09:46,233
Por favor, pare de chorar.

727
01:09:49,609 --> 01:09:51,822
Vamos embora juntos.

728
01:09:51,823 --> 01:09:55,407
Vou encontrar a chave,
fique tranquilo.

729
01:09:55,824 --> 01:09:57,284
Abra a porta.

730
01:09:57,786 --> 01:09:59,911
Perdi a chave.

731
01:10:01,372 --> 01:10:03,540
- Procure.
- Eu a perdi.

732
01:10:03,541 --> 01:10:05,124
Procure!

733
01:10:05,125 --> 01:10:06,586
<i>Estou com medo!</i>

734
01:10:07,420 --> 01:10:10,005
<i>Deixe-me sair, estou com medo!</i>

735
01:10:10,966 --> 01:10:12,267
